# Tiny capacity trace for a realistic four-slot local cluster.
# capacity(t)=clip(round(1.5 + 1.1*sin(2*pi*t/240s)
#   + 0.5*sin(2*pi*t/95s) + burst(t)), 1, 4).
# The trace starts at the minimum one-worker floor, ramps to four workers,
# removes the source during a pressure drop, then alternates recovery adds and
# removals without ever naming a slot outside node-0..node-3.
